# Core: Node is not a Qt process

Do not put Qt windows, PySide, or QApplication in `src/corvus_node/` (except a thin `corvus gui` launcher). GUI runtime lives under `gui/corvus_gui/`.

When you add or change a host AF_UNIX control RPC, update `docs/gui/AVAILABLE.md` in the same change. Mark matching rows in `gui/REQUESTS.md` `shipped` or `rejected`.

The GUI is the same operator layer as the CLI. It talks to Node over AF_UNIX only. No TCP product mode. No Firecracker from the GUI.
